OnCalendar=*-*-* 09:36:00 Asia/Shanghai
OnCalendar=*-*-* 10:06:00 Asia/Shanghai
OnCalendar=*-*-* 15:06:00 Asia/Shanghai
OnCalendar=*-*-* 20:40:00 Asia/Shanghai
OnCalendar=*-*-* 21:40:00 Asia/Shanghai
OnCalendar=*-*-* 23:10:00 Asia/Shanghai
